[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Tilting the controller moves the pointer, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}.
The right stick {rs} moves the pointer. Hold {rt} or {south} to grab a thing and drag it; let go to drop it. {lt} or {east} right-clicks, for a thing's context menu.
The left stick {ls} pans the camera (WASD); click {l3} and move the pointer to drag the view instead. {up} and {down} zoom (the wheel).
While dragging, hold {lb} or {rb} to turn the thing (Q and E). {west} activates what is under the pointer (F): fire a gun, start an engine.
{north} pauses time (Space). {left} undoes (Ctrl+Z) and {right} deletes the selection. {select} lists copy, paste, undo and delete.
{start} opens the menu. Naming a save needs typing: {guide} + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard.
The keys are remembered defaults, unchecked on an install; the game lets you change them in its settings, so if one doesn't answer, check there.'''

